  "rationale": [
    "Import original query blocks and mark result/effect ownership explicitly on each root.",
    "Retain block boundaries in transaction order and place each block materialization directly before its execution, with correct transaction/result indices.",
    "Build result channels only for result roots; effect sinks do not receive final gathering or narrowing.",
    "Keep result bindings when the same transaction has effects; export and annotate the physical query directly instead of replacing overlapping nested containers.",
    "Attach the RBO query plan to every physical transaction, and combine per-transaction runtime statistics by stage GUID before serializing the complete analysis plan.",
    "Refresh final-query lambda dependency scopes and canonicalize expressions after direct export, preserving the prior host post-annotation invariants.",
    "Use the standard local type/post-type annotation pipeline so constraint completion precedes final scope refresh and canonicalization; keep annotation restarts local to the exported physical query."
  ],
